# Intentional public barrels — the two files package.json "exports" declares as
# @rkr/image-edit's entry points ("." and "./canvas"). Consumers import the
# package specifier, never its internal layout, so these re-exports are the
# package boundary rather than avoidable indirection.
#
# Both use named re-exports, so the public surface stays explicit and a leaf
# module cannot widen it by adding an export. Nothing else in this repo is
# allowed a barrel — src/ has zero.

packages/image-edit/src/canvas/index.ts
packages/image-edit/src/core/index.ts
